### Send Email Notification
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient": "user@example.com",
  "channel": "EMAIL",
  "title": "Welcome!",
  "content": "Thanks for joining us."
}

### Test validation error (empty title)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient": "user@example.com",
  "channel": "EMAIL",
  "title": "",
  "content": "Thanks for joining us."
}